1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,530
A young scientist stands by a lake observing water
evaporation in the morning sun.

2
00:00:05,530 --> 00:00:09,490
She points to the clouds forming high above the mountains.

3
00:00:09,490 --> 00:00:14,810
The scientist explains how water vapor rises and cools in
the atmosphere.

4
00:00:14,810 --> 00:00:19,329
Dark clouds gather and begin to release raindrops over the
forest.

5
00:00:19,329 --> 00:00:23,460
The rain falls gently on trees and flows into streams.

6
00:00:23,460 --> 00:00:27,820
The scientist follows the water as it travels back to the
lake.

7
00:00:27,820 --> 00:00:33,100
She demonstrates the complete cycle using simple diagrams
in her notebook.
